# B"H
# Boruch Hashem
# Blessed is He
#
# The Awtsmoos renews each boundary without carrying yesterday's shadows.
# Awtsmoos.com keeps source in Git while runtime state, proofs, caches,
# generated media, archives, and machine residue remain outside.
# Local Awtsmoos tunnel and agent state.
**/.[aA]wtsmoos*/
**/[aA][wW][tT][sS][mM][oO][oO][sS]/
*.awtsmoos.log
.[aA]wtsmoos*.local.json
.ai_tmp_*
.awtsmoos-tmp/
.Awtsmoos-tmp/
# Mitzvah World runtime media lives in authenticated Awtsmoos Drive.
geelooy/games/mitzvahWorld/assets/
geelooy/games/mitzvahWorld/references/
# Planning and generated thought archives.
**/.ai-thoughts/
**/[aA][iI][-_][tT][hH][oO][uU][gG][hH][tT][sS]/
geelooy/ai/thoughts/
meluket_*_probe.json
meluket_*_*.txt
# Generated proof, inspection, and recovery material.
.awtsmoos-artifacts/
geelooy/apps/animator/proofs/
inspection-shared-world/
traces/
**/.reports/
**/reports/
**/screenshots/
**/visual-proof/
**/review-output/
**/simulator-results/
**/.sim/*.json
**/.sim/*.jsonl
**/lastChrome*.json
**/lastNodeDom*.json
**/fullGameplay*.json
**/*evidence*.*
**/tests/chrome/*.json
**/tests/chrome/*.png
# Mutable runtime state, caches, logs, and temporary output.
**/.data/
**/.logs/
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.vite/
**/.nyc_output/
**/__pycache__/
**/coverage/
**/node_modules/
**/runtime-cache/
**/execution-plans/*.json
**/tmp/
**/temp/
command-output/
*.py[cod]
*.log
*.out
*.err
# Database and generated shard artifacts.
searchPacked/
*.bin
*.awtsbin
*.awtsdb*
*.awtsidx
